row('A01','checklist','1 · Establish ownership and origin','Execution dossier should reconcile legal account owner, bank classification, acquisition dates and fund category against statements and source records. Citizenship alone does not resolve current/capital classification. No personal evidence was supplied; those fields remain blank.','S01 S02 S03','Classification / authenticity rules',status='Analysis')
row('A02','checklist','2 · Reconcile taxes already paid','For employment funds, reconcile employer statement/contract, salary deposits and Chinese tax certificates, then check U.S. reporting. Distinguish a documentary tax certificate from a demand for a new tax payment.','S03 S04 S11','Employment documents; worldwide-income rule',status='Analysis')
row('A03','checklist','3 · Obtain a written reason for any bank refusal','Recommended bank/adviser follow-up: identify missing source evidence, account-identity mismatch, capital-account approval, unpaid tax or compliance freeze. No reason for this user’s bank restriction has been confirmed.','S01 S02 S04','Bank authenticity review and classification',status='Analysis')
row('A04','checklist','4 · Compare only eligible, executable quotes','Use the same total CNY debit, destination, quote time and final USD-credit basis for a bank wire, eligible Wise route and eligible HSBC route. Record rate direction and every deduction; no quote is assumed here.','S05 S06 S07','Provider terms; bank rates and tariff',status='Analysis')
row('A05','checklist','5 · Resolve historical U.S. compliance separately','Review account maximums and prior returns/FBARs before selecting any remedial procedure; suspected willfulness requires tax counsel. Moving the balance or choosing a smaller payment is not a filing cure.','S14 S19 S20 S21','FBAR and streamlined criteria',status='Analysis')
row('A06','checklist','6 · Execute through authorized institutions','Bank identity checks, signed authorization, accepted documents and private account access are still necessary. This project is public research only: it cannot authorize or perform transfers or file returns for the user.','S01 S02 S04','Bank review; representative requirements',status='Analysis')
row('A07','checklist','7 · Keep the audit trail','Keep source documents, conversion and wire confirmations, tax receipts and USD-basis records. FBAR records generally retained five years from due date. Do not upload passports, bank numbers or tax records to this public repository.','S14 S17','Keeping records; USD reporting',status='Analysis')
