row('F02','review','Conflicting $50,000 descriptions','HSBC guide says foreign settlement and purchase by non-mainland individuals are subject to a USD50,000 facilitation quota. SAFE Art.2 specifies individual settlement and domestic-individual purchase, while Art.13 and the 2026 FAQ specify documentary foreign-individual lawful-income purchase. Do not promise ID-only conversion for this user or treat USD50,000 as a universal salary ceiling.','S04 S02 S03','HSBC opening quota paragraph; SAFE Arts.2,13; 2026 answer',status='Needs review',cons='Official-text discrepancy flagged. Bank implementation/legal interpretation must be resolved for execution.')
