row('F05','review','Property, inheritance, migration and business applicability','No title, inheritance instrument, SAFE approval, immigration dates or corporate/debt registration has been supplied. Published category descriptions do not establish personal eligibility.','S02 S04','Arts.20–21; bank property sections',status='Unverified')
row('F06','review','Statutory edition and treaty limitations','Section 988 reference is the official 2024 edition, not an independently verified 2026 consolidation. Treaty index checked but treaty articles not applied. State and third-country rules not verified.','S18 S24 S11','Edition heading; treaty index',status='Needs review',cons='Prior-session summary asserted a cheapest wire route, quota staging and a blanket treaty dividend rate. These assumptions are not adopted in this integrated dashboard; earlier files are preserved for audit. Individual eligibility and treaty entitlement remain unverified.')
